<title>UK: Rolls expects up to $75 mln from SilkAir.</title>
<headline>Rolls expects up to $75 mln from SilkAir.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Rolls-Royce Plc said on Monday that its share of a contract won by International Aero Engines from SilkAir was worth up to $75 million.</p>
</text>
